<title>BELGIUM: EU's de Silguy sees good chance for stability pact.</title>
<headline>EU's de Silguy sees good chance for stability pact.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union Monetary Affairs Commissioner said on Thursday propects were good that EU finance ministers would agree a post-EMU stability pact at a meeting in Dublin on September 21.</p>
<p>&quot;I think we will have the basis for a compromise in Dublin,&quot; de Silguy said in an interview with Reuters. &quot;Countries must be in no doubt that persistent deficits (after Economic and Monetary Union) will be penalised.&quot;</p>
</text>
